{"title":"1989 AJHSME Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> is between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/6/b7616a230c77f0d9a577e5bca01aa06f1c35c457.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.  The average of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> could be\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/9/5d9dabca1bb0b0c74460b81926a118b6ae8aff0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 8 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 10 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 12 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 14 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"366\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The smallest possible average is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/6/8166dacc8f78fc90fb2c04fa99f0faa8b7f7b8cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{6 + 10 + 9}{3} = \\frac{25}{3} = 8\\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"179\" height=\"38\" />, while the highest possible average is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37d4fd25044b9bb8028c49aee19e554af7e1bf7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{6+10+17}{3} = \\frac{33}{3} = 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"185\" height=\"38\" />.  The only answer choice between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/6/33611c92d5a4fd439fe1941d50f6528f0de2a24a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8\\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/e/22e718d67af3d365942b25dcef3ffe8d2a48ad9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"64\" height=\"28\" />, which would be the average if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/b/62b0dd244d965da79733287f3011c92ddd838b7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-brac